  "content": {
    "title": "庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年歌唱祖国主题党日",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-09-30",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:28.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2019年9月30日，明天即将迎来伟大祖国70华诞，在这举国欢庆的日子里，吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心党总支开展庆祝中华人民共和国70周年歌唱祖国主题党日活动，庆祝祖国生日，弘扬爱国主义。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:28.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/214bb048460f7d2431d643654f4dd4b45282b23e509cdd228471a68922f235fd.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:28.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/675495e2cf500ccf951e4f13c8313ce6feb981896d38d01fd286924ee78127b1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:28.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\